    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the book <strong>Story for Karol</strong> from <strong>Friedrich Alfredo Stevenson</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Karol World Breaker</strong> brings classic <strong>brick-breaking gameplay</strong> together with <strong>Survivors-like mechanics</strong> in a single game. Destroy enemies with your balls and <strong>power-ups</strong>. <strong>Collect</strong> <strong>coins</strong> that you can use to buy power-up items in the <strong>Store</strong> to help you in holding out against waves of falling enemies. These <strong>wise</strong> <strong>Enemies</strong> are capable of <strong>spawning debuffs</strong> that will make your adventure more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/488b88626bce7215011a28a578b40237.poster.avif?t=1747073238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/488b88626bce7215011a28a578b40237.webm?t=1747073238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/488b88626bce7215011a28a578b40237.mp4?t=1747073238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Karol World Breaker</strong> ancient wisdom meets modern <strong>Roguelike</strong> gaming in a touching tale that will captivate you.  <br> <br>Follow <strong>Karol</strong> as she unexpectedly finds herself transported into a <strong>mysterious</strong> video game world unlike any she's played before. She encounters digital manifestations of great thinkers through levels filled with <strong>powerful life lessons</strong>. When loneliness threatens to overwhelm her, Karol must learn that true companionship begins with <strong>understanding herself.</strong>  <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/bc73106671fc591a3b39765bae1781e7.avif?t=1747073238\" width=800 height=258 /></span><br>Karol unlocks timeless wisdom that helps her see her real-world challenges in a new light. As she progresses through this <strong>unusual adventure</strong>, she discovers that the most important power-ups aren't the ones that make her stronger or faster, but those that make her wiser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a thoughtfully crafted world where:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video game excitement meets philosophical discovery</strong>  <br><strong>Beautiful illustrations bring both digital and spiritual worlds to life</strong>  <br><strong>Complex ideas become accessible through playful storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/00307f0b167acc9892722fd8e1dc07c8.poster.avif?t=1747073238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/00307f0b167acc9892722fd8e1dc07c8.webm?t=1747073238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646130/extras/00307f0b167acc9892722fd8e1dc07c8.mp4?t=1747073238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
